<section class="saas-legal-page">
  <div class="saas-container saas-page-shell">
    <div class="saas-page-hero">
      <p class="saas-legal-kicker">Holiday Generator</p>

      <h1>AI Christmas Sticker Generator</h1>

      <p>
        Generate Christmas stickers with AI from a text prompt. Create festive icons, winter
        characters, and holiday reactions in minutes. Free to try with no sign up.
      </p>
      <a class="saas-button saas-button-primary" href="/#generator">
        Generate Christmas Stickers
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="saas-info-grid">
      <article class="saas-info-panel">
        <h2>One subject per prompt</h2>

        <p>
          Name the holiday object or character first, then add a mood and a clean sticker border.
          Short prompts stay readable at chat size.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="saas-info-panel">
        <h2>Build a small holiday set</h2>

        <p>
          Use batch mode with one Christmas prompt per line to generate a matching set of festive
          reactions or icons.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="saas-info-panel">
        <h2>Free guest trial</h2>

        <p>
          Guests get 3 free generations with no sign up. Extra generations use one-time credit
          packs. There is no subscription.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>

    <section class="saas-seo-block">
      <h2>How to generate Christmas stickers</h2>

      <ol>
        <li>Enter a Christmas sticker prompt with one subject and a holiday mood.</li>

        <li>Generate without signing up if you still have guest credits.</li>

        <li>Retry or vary the prompt for a small holiday sticker set.</li>

        <li>Download completed PNG or WebP stickers from history.</li>
      </ol>
    </section>

    <section class="saas-seo-block">
      <h2>Holiday prompt formulas</h2>

      <div class="saas-prompt-list">
        <code>[holiday object] sticker, [emotion], snowy colors, clean white border</code>
        <code>christmas [animal] wearing a scarf, cute winter sticker, simple background</code>
        <code>festive [food] character, cozy smile, kawaii holiday sticker</code>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="saas-seo-block">
      <h2>When to use this generator</h2>

      <p>
        Use the AI Christmas sticker generator when you want original holiday artwork from a
        prompt. It is not a catalog of ready-made Christmas stickers for sale. Start with one
        festive idea, generate, then refine.
      </p>

      <div class="saas-related-links">
        <.link navigate={~p"/christmas-ai-sticker-maker"}>Christmas AI Sticker Maker</.link>
        <.link navigate={~p"/ai-sticker-generator"}>AI Sticker Generator</.link>
        <.link navigate={~p"/cute-sticker-ideas"}>Cute Sticker Ideas</.link>
        <.link navigate={~p"/sticker-maker-online"}>Sticker Maker Online</.link>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="saas-faq">
      <details open>
        <summary>How do I generate Christmas stickers with AI?</summary>

        <p>
          Describe one festive subject, add a sticker style, and generate. Short prompts stay
          cleaner at small sizes.
        </p>
      </details>

      <details>
        <summary>Is the Christmas sticker generator free?</summary>

        <p>
          Guests get 3 free generations with no sign up. Extra generations use one-time credit
          packs.
        </p>
      </details>

      <details>
        <summary>Can I make a holiday sticker pack?</summary>

        <p>
          Yes. Add one Christmas prompt per line in batch mode to generate a small matching set.
        </p>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
